{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964480/extras/a276f94ecf1bfa20438f5f4eb949d780.poster.avif?t=1757113161\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964480/extras/a276f94ecf1bfa20438f5f4eb949d780.webm?t=1757113161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964480/extras/a276f94ecf1bfa20438f5f4eb949d780.mp4?t=1757113161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sunny Shores combines\u00a0the aesthetics of\u00a03D lofi and the creative freedom of\u00a0a block-based sandbox. Features include: dynamic lighting, changing seasons, weather events, and much more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964480/extras/269074e68886b351d0631a819a32512e.poster.avif?t=1757113161\" width=1170 height=494 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964480/extras/269074e68886b351d0631a819a32512e.webm?t=1757113161\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964480/extras/269074e68886b351d0631a819a32512e.mp4?t=1757113161\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with friends, or play with yourself: Hunt, fish, forage, build and\u00a0craft\u00a0to survive in an infinite open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3964480/extras/44b21f2bc96f6f2a2c818f3ceed27ad2.poster.avif?t=1757113161\" width=1170 height=494 ><source sr